     "scene_009": {
       "title": "The Hammer",
-      "text": "\nYou flip The Can Opener around so the hammer face leads the way. The Construction Bot raises its own hammer, and hey, fair’s fair, but you don’t wait for it to come down.\n\nWHAM! You hit it square in the knee, and the whole bot wobbles.\n\nWHAM! The second swing dents one of its foot thrusters, and it starts sputtering. Now the bot can only hop in circles, which would be really funny if it wasn’t also swinging a hammer.\n\nYou time it. Hop…hop…THERE.\n\nYou bring the hammer down on the power housing behind its head. Something inside goes POP, and the bot hops one last time and sits down against the curb.\n\nIts eyes fade from angry red to a soft blue, then go dark.\n\nYour arms feel like noodles.\n\n“Excellent form, sir,” Asher says. “Very little of the street was harmed.”\n\nYou look at the knocked-over streetlight and the flattened mailbox.\n\n“That was the bot, not me.”\n\n“Of course, sir.”\n",
+      "text": "\nYou flip The Can Opener around so the hammer face leads the way. The Construction Bot raises its own hammer, and hey, fair’s fair, but you don’t wait for it to finish its swing.\n\nWHAM! You hit it square in the knee, and the whole bot wobbles.\n\nWHAM! The second swing dents one of its foot thrusters, and it starts sputtering. Now the bot can only hop in circles, which would be really funny if it wasn’t also swinging a hammer at you.\n\nYou time it. Hop…hop…THERE.\n\nYou bring the hammer down on the power housing behind its head. Something inside goes POP, and the bot hops one last time and falls down against the curb.\n\nIts eyes fade from angry red to a soft blue, then go dark.\n\nYour arms feel like noodles.\n\n“Excellent form, sir,” Asher says. “Very little of the street was harmed.”\n\nYou look at the knocked-over streetlight and the flattened mailbox.\n\n“That was the bot!!” you shout to Asher in mock outrage.\n\n“Of course, sir.”\n",
