       "title": "Grab the Shield Prototype",
-      "text": "\nYou scramble back down the ladder and into the garage.\n\n“Asher, where’s the shield thing?”\n\n“The unfinished energy shield, sir? Under the pizza box. I would like to remind you that it is unfinished.”\n\nYou grab it off the workbench. It’s ugly, it’s unstable, and it’s held together with tape, but it might work. It’s an armband, covered in duct tape and glowing blue dots with a power pack wired to the side.\n\nYou strap it around your left forearm and run outside with The Can Opener in your right hand. The Construction Bot spots you and comes hopping over on its rocket feet, hammer raised.\n\nYou flip the switch.\n\nThe shield flickers to life just in time, a wobbly circle of blue light about as wide as a trash can lid.\n\nOk…now what?\n",
