       "title": "Shield Up, Charge!",
-      "text": "\nYou tuck in behind the wobbly blue circle and run straight at the bot.\n\nThe hammer comes down and the shield catches it with a sound like a giant bell. You feel the hit all the way up to your shoulder…but it holds!\n\nYou shove the hammer aside, slide in close, and swing the hammer face of The Can Opener into the bot’s knee. Then again. The bot tips, catches itself with a little blast from its thrusters, and tips again. One more hit, right behind the head, and it sits down with a THUNK. Its eyes fade from angry red to soft blue, then go dark.\n\nYou look at the shield. The blue light fizzles, pops, and dies, and a piece of tape slowly peels off and floats to the ground.\n\n“It worked!” you tell Asher. “Once!”\n\n“A proud day, sir.”\n",
+      "text": "\nYou tuck in behind the wobbly blue circle and run straight at the bot.\n\nThe hammer comes down and the shield catches it with a loud buzzing noise, like a bug that flew into a bug zapper. You feel the hit all the way up to your shoulder…but it holds!\n\nYou shove the hammer aside, slide in close, and swing the hammer face of The Can Opener into the bot’s knee over and over. The bot tips, catches itself with a little blast from its thrusters, and tips again. One more hit from above, right behind the head, and it sits down with a THUNK. Its eyes fade from angry red to soft blue, then go dark.\n\nYou look at the shield. The blue light fizzles, pops, and dies, and a piece of tape slowly peels off and floats to the ground.\n\n“It worked!” you tell Asher. “I’m gonna need to work on the power thing, though…and the tape.”\n\n“A proud day, sir.”\n",
