     "scene_015": {
       "title": "Hold the Line",
-      "text": "\nYou plant your feet, raise your left forearm, and brace it with your right hand.\n\nThe hammer slams into it. Then a big metal fist. Then the hammer again. Every hit makes the blue light ripple like a puddle and pushes you back a step, but the bot is already beat up and it’s burning through its power fast.\n\nSlam, step. Slam, step. Slam, step.\n\n“Sir, its power levels are dropping,” Asher says. “Also, so are the shield’s. I am not sure who is going to win this one.”\n\n“NOT helping!”\n\nThe bot winds up for one more swing…and just stops. Its arms lower, its thrusters sputter out, and its eyes fade from angry red to soft blue, then go dark.\n\nYou never even had to hit it.\n\nA second later the shield fizzles out and a piece of tape peels off the side. Your arms are tingling all the way up to your elbows.\n",
+      "text": "\nYou plant your feet, raise your left forearm, and brace it with your right hand.\n\nThe hammer slams into it, followed by a big metal fist, then the hammer again. Every hit makes the blue light ripple like a puddle and pushes you back a step, but the bot is already beat up and it’s burning through its power fast.\n\nSlam, step. Slam, step. Slam, step.\n\n“Sir, its power levels are dropping,” Asher says. “Also, so are the shield’s. I am not sure who is going to win this one.”\n\n“Thanks for the vote of confidence!!”\n\nThe bot winds up for one more swing…and just stops. Its arms lower, its thrusters sputter out, and its eyes fade from angry red to soft blue, then go dark.\n\nYou never even had to hit it.\n\nA second later the shield fizzles out and a piece of tape peels off the side. Your arms are tingling all the way up to your elbows, but you made it.\n",
