     "scene_025": {
       "title": "Wrong Tool",
-      "text": "\nThe Can Opener hasn’t failed you yet. You twist the handle, the blade crackles to life, and you CHARGE.\n\nThe Load-Bot doesn’t even swing at you. It just slides its forklift prongs under The Can Opener and lifts…and you’re still holding on.\n\n“Put me down!”\n\nIt does. By throwing you.\n\nYou sail across the loading zone and land in a pile of empty cardboard boxes, and The Can Opener lands right next to you a second later.\n\nYou lie there looking up at the sky.\n\n“Are you injured, sir?” Asher asks from your phone.\n\n“Just my feelings.”\n\n“The Can Opener is a wonderful tool, sir. For that bot, it is the wrong tool. Its reach is longer than yours.”\n\nYou climb out of the boxes and brush yourself off. Right. THAT’S why you built the other thing.\n",
+      "text": "\nThe Can Opener hasn’t failed you yet. You twist the handle, the blade crackles to life, and you CHARGE.\n\nThe Load-Bot doesn’t even swing at you. It just slides its forklift prongs under The Can Opener and lifts…and you’re still holding on.\n\n“Put me down!”\n\nIt does. By throwing you like a crate full of oranges.\n\nYou sail across the loading zone and land in a pile of empty cardboard boxes, and The Can Opener lands right next to you a second later.\n\nYou lie there looking up at the sky.\n\n“Are you injured, sir?” Asher asks from your phone.\n\n“Mostly just my ego, Asher.”\n\n“The Can Opener is a wonderful tool, sir. For that bot, it is the wrong one, though. Its reach is longer than yours.”\n\nYou climb out of the boxes and brush yourself off. Right. THAT’S why you built the other thingie.\n",
