-      "text": "\nTHWOOM!\n\nThe rock hits dead center in a burst of blue light, and the Load-Bot rolls back a few feet. Then it rolls forward again, still smiling, and keeps coming.\n\nTHWOOM! Another direct hit, another wobble. There’s a dent in the armor now…but that’s all.\n\n“Sir, that chest plate is far thicker than the Construction Bot’s. You are not going to punch through it.”\n\nOne shot left. So you stop looking at where the bot is strong and start looking at where it isn’t…the wheels! All that weight is balanced on those big round rolling wheels.\n\nTHWOOM!\n\nThe rock smashes into the front left wheel, and it pops right off its axle. The Load-Bot tips forward, spins in a slow, sad circle, and crashes onto its face with a BOOM that sets off a car alarm.\n\nIt’s down, but it’s not out. Its forklift arms are still flailing, and your coil is empty. But it can’t reach behind itself.\n",
+      "text": "\nTHWOOM!\n\nThe rock hits dead center in a burst of blue light, and the Load-Bot rolls back a few feet. Then it rolls forward again, still smiling, and keeps coming.\n\nTHWOOM! Another direct hit, another wobble. There’s a dent in the armor now…but that’s all.\n\n“Sir, that chest plate is far thicker than the Construction Bot’s. You are not going to punch through it.”\n\nOne shot left. So you stop looking at where the bot is strong and start looking at where it isn’t…the omniwheels! All that weight is balanced on those big round rolling wheels.\n\nTHWOOM!\n\nThe rock smashes into the front left wheel, and it pops right off its axle. The Load-Bot tips forward, spins in a slow, sad, comical circle, and crashes onto its face with a BOOM that sets off a car alarm.\n\nIt’s down, but it’s not out. Its forklift arms are still flailing, and you are out of shots.\n",
