     "scene_034": {
       "title": "Reinforce",
-      "text": "\nYou are DONE holding things together with your thumb.\n\nYou rebuild Shield Cover Me from the ground up: real bolts, a proper housing for the emitter, and a bigger power pack wired to the side. You cut a curved brace from the Security Bot’s armor and fit it inside the armband, with padding underneath and fresh duct tape over the wiring. The blue dots still glow through the gaps. Now it stays snug on your left forearm without you holding anything together. Tap the switch beside your wrist, and the blue circle opens up in front of your arm.\n\nYou try it. Tap! The shield opens up, wide and steady.\n\nYou count. Ten seconds. Twenty. Thirty. At forty it starts getting warm, so you shut it off.\n\n“Forty seconds of cover, sir. A big improvement over one thumb.”\n\n“Shield Cover Me,” you say, trying it out. “I still can’t believe that’s the name.”\n\n“I think it is your best one, sir.”\n\n“YOU named it!”\n\n“As I said.”\n",
+      "text": "\nYou are DONE holding things together with your thumb.\n\nYou rebuild Shield Cover Me from the ground up: real bolts, a proper housing for the emitter, and a bigger power pack wired to the side. You cut a curved brace from the Security Bot’s armor and fit it inside the armband, with padding underneath and fresh duct tape over the wiring. The blue dots still glow through the gaps. Now it stays snug on your left forearm without you holding anything together. Tap the switch beside your wrist, and the blue circle opens up in front of your arm.\n\nYou try it. Tap! The shield opens up, wide and steady.\n\nYou count. Ten seconds. Twenty. Thirty. At forty it starts getting warm, so you shut it off.\n\n“Forty seconds of cover, sir. A big improvement over holding it together with your thumb.”\n\n“Shield Cover Me,” you say, trying it out. “I still can’t believe that’s the name.”\n\n“I think it is your best one, sir.”\n\n“YOU named it!”\n\n“As I said.”\n",
