     "scene_040": {
       "title": "Two Ideas",
-      "text": "\nYou grab a marker and write on the garage wall, because you ran out of paper a long time ago.\n\nPROBLEM 1: Couldn’t get to it.\n\nThe bot was three stories up and you were stuck on the ground. More firepower wouldn’t have fixed that. You need to get to places you can’t get to now.\n\nPROBLEM 2: Couldn’t see it coming.\n\nAsher is the smartest one on the team, and he was stuck in the garage listening through a phone in your pocket. He couldn’t see the bot, and he couldn’t tell you when it was about to fire. And if somebody really did add that code on purpose, the only place he can learn more is out there, next to a bot that’s still running.\n\nYou tap the marker against your chin.\n\n“I don’t need a bigger blaster. I need to move better…and I need you with me.”\n\n“I would like that very much, sir. I have never been outside before.”\n\nTwo ideas. Boots that can climb, and an Asher you can carry.\n",
+      "text": "\nYou grab a marker and write on the garage wall, because you ran out of paper a long time ago.\n\nPROBLEM 1: Couldn’t get to it.\n\nThe bot was three stories up and you were stuck on the ground. More firepower wouldn’t have fixed that. You need to get to places you can’t get to now.\n\nPROBLEM 2: Couldn’t see it coming.\n\nAsher can only help so much listening in from a phone in your pocket. He couldn’t see the bot, and he couldn’t tell you when it was about to fire. And if somebody really did add that code on purpose, the only place he can learn more is out there, next to a bot that’s still running.\n\nYou tap the marker against your chin.\n\n“I don’t need a bigger blaster. I need to move better…and I need you with me.”\n\n“I would like that very much, sir. I have never been outside before.”\n\nTwo ideas. Boots that can climb, and a portable Asher.\n",
