     "scene_054": {
       "title": "Drone Spotted",
-      "text": "\nYou’re halfway to the fence when Asher sounds in your ear.\n\n“Drone, sir! Coming back around. Hide!”\n\nThere’s nowhere to hide. It’s an open lot with nothing in it but a metal awning over the loading dock…\n\n…a METAL awning.\n\nYou run, jump, and click your heels, and The Stompers clang onto the underside of the awning. You hang there upside down like a bat, holding your breath, with your backpack dangling under you.\n\nThe drone hums past right below you, close enough that you can see its camera lens turning and read the gold letters printed on its side.\n\nPROPERTY OF M. GRABS. IF FOUND, IT IS STILL MINE.\n\nIt scans the empty lot, sees nothing, and floats up through the hatch in the roof.\n\nYou let your breath out.\n\n“Sir,” Asher whispers, “you have a granola bar wrapper falling out of your pocket.”\n\nYou catch it with two fingers. Way, WAY too close.\n\nSo it isn’t just a signal. Somebody is watching the whole neighborhood…and now you know his name.\n",
+      "text": "\nYou’re halfway to the fence when Asher sounds in your ear.\n\n“Drone, sir! Coming back around. Hide!”\n\nThere’s nowhere to hide. It’s an open lot with nothing in it but a metal awning over the loading dock…\n\n…a METAL awning.\n\nYou run, jump, and click your heels, and The Stompers clang onto the underside of the awning. You hang there upside down like a bat, holding your breath, with your backpack dangling off you.\n\nThe drone hums past right below you, close enough that you can see its camera lens turning and read the gold letters printed on its side.\n\nPROPERTY OF M. GRABS. IF FOUND, IT IS STILL MINE.\n\nIt scans the empty lot, sees nothing, and floats up through the hatch in the roof.\n\nYou let your breath out.\n\n“Sir,” Asher whispers, “you have a granola bar wrapper falling out of your pocket.”\n\nYou catch it with two fingers. Way, WAY too close.\n\nSo it isn’t just a signal. Somebody is watching the whole neighborhood…and now you know who.\n",
