+      "text": "\nYou spend the rest of the day getting ready. You charge everything, put a fresh power core in The Can Opener, and tuck a spare—the very best one you’ve got—into a padded pouch on your belt. Then you fill your pockets with landscaping rocks.\n\nThen you lay it all out on the workbench and check it twice.\n\nThe Can Opener, for up close. The Wrist Wrock-It, three shots and then a minute. Shield Cover Me, forty seconds. The Stompers, attract and repel. And Asher Portable, who clicks into place over your eye.\n\n“Sir, may I say something?”\n\n“Always.”\n\n“A few days ago, you had your dad’s old wrench. I have watched you build every one of these, and I have watched you fall off, get stuck to, and get launched by most of them. I would not go out there with anyone else.”\n\nYou have to clear your throat before you can answer.\n\n“Thanks, bud. Let’s go save the neighborhood.”\n\nYou reach the cannery just after dark.\n",
