+      "text": "\nYou twist the handle of The Can Opener. Then you keep twisting, past the click, and past the second click that you put there so you’d never do this by accident.\n\nThe coils go from blue to white. The wrench head opens wide, lightning starts crawling up and down the handle, and every hair on your arms stands straight up. The whole cannery fills with a rising hum.\n\n“Sir, this will empty the core completely,” Asher says. “The Can Opener will be powerless after this.”\n\n“I know.”\n\nYou raise it. Grabs stops laughing and freezes.\n\n“Wait! You wouldn’t dare!”\n\nYour eyes shift past him, toward the glowing control tower.\n\n“You’re right,” you say. “I wouldn’t. But it’s going to be a spectacular GAS explosion.”\n",
