     "scene_066": {
       "title": "Precision",
-      "text": "\nThe blast shoots right past Max Grabs, close enough to ruffle his robe, and hits the control tower dead center.\n\nFor a second, the whole room is as bright as noon.\n\nEvery terminal goes dark at once. The Robot Improver 3 makes a sound like a very large balloon letting go, and its lights go out row by row. On the roof, the antenna stops humming.\n\nAnd all across {world_name}, in alleys and empty lots and the middle of Elm Street, every haywire robot slows down, lowers its arms, and stops. Hundreds of flickering red lights fade to a soft, calm blue.\n\nThe Can Opener is dark in your hands. No glow, no hum. Just a big, heavy wrench again.\n\nGrabs looks at the smoking machine. He looks at you. His face goes from white, to pink, to PURPLE.\n\n“THAT WAS PRIVATE PROPERTY!”\n\nHe stomps his foot, and a slipper flies off.\n\n“You tried to VAPORIZE me!”\n\n“I was aiming at your computer.”\n\n“THAT’S EVEN WORSE!”\n\nHe throws his remote control on the floor and jumps on it. He pulls off his other slipper and throws that too. It doesn’t go very far.\n\n“Do you have ANY IDEA how much GAS I put into this?!”\n\n“Yeah,” you say. “We could all tell.”\n\n“GAS will be BACK!”\n\n“It usually is.”\n\nSomewhere outside, getting closer, you hear sirens.\n",
+      "text": "\nThe blast shoots right past Max Grabs, close enough to ruffle his robe, and hits the control tower dead center.\n\nFor a second, the whole room is as bright as noon.\n\nEvery terminal goes dark at once. The Robot Improver 3 makes a sound like a very large balloon letting go, and its lights go out row by row. On the roof, the antenna stops humming.\n\nAnd all across {world_name}, in alleys and empty lots and the middle of Elm Street, every haywire robot slows down, lowers its arms, and stops. Hundreds of flickering red lights fade to a soft, calm blue.\n\nThe Can Opener is dark in your hands. No glow, no hum. Just a big, heavy wrench again.\n\nGrabs looks at the smoking machine. He looks at you. His face goes from white, to pink, to PURPLE.\n\n“THAT WAS PRIVATE PROPERTY!”\n\nHe stomps his foot, and a slipper flies off.\n\n“You tried to VAPORIZE me!”\n\n“I was aiming at your computer.”\n\n“THAT’S EVEN WORSE!”\n\nHe throws his remote control on the floor and jumps on it. He pulls off his other slipper and throws that too. It doesn’t go very far.\n\n“Do you have ANY IDEA how much GAS I put into this?!”\n\n“Yeah, we could all tell,” you say as you pretend to wave a bad smell away from your nose.\n\n“GAS will be BACK!”\n\n“Why, did you eat a lot of beans?”\n\nSomewhere outside, getting closer, you hear sirens.\n",
